{title: Birds of a Feather}
{artist: Billie Eilish}
{key: D}

{start_of_verse: Intro}
[D]
(I want you to stay)
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
I want you to [D]stay
'Til I'm in the [Bm]grave
'Til I rot a[Em]way, dead and buried
'Til I'm in the [A]casket you carry
If you go, I'm goin' [D]too, uh
'Cause it was always [Bm]you (Alright)
And if I'm turnin' [Em]blue, please don't save me
Nothin' left to [A]lose without my baby
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Refrain}
[D]Birds of a feather, we should stick together, I know[Bm]
I said I'd never think I wasn't better alone
[Em]Can't change the weather, might not be forever
But if [A]it's forever, it's even better
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[D]And I don't know what I'm cryin' [Bm]for
I don't think I could love you [Em]more
It might not be long, but, baby, [A]I
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
I'll love you 'til the day that I [D]die
'Til the day that I [Bm]die
'Til the light leaves my [Em]eyes
'Til the day that I [A]die
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
I want you to [D]see, hmm
How you look to [Bm]me, hmm
You wouldn't be[Em]lieve if I told ya
You would keep the [A]compliments I throw ya
But you're so full of [D]shit, uh
Tell me it's a [Bm]bit, oh
Say you don't see [Em]it, your mind's polluted
Say you wanna [A]quit, don't be stupid
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[D]And I don't know what I'm cryin' [Bm]for
I don't think I could love you [Em]more
Might not be long, but, baby, [A]I
Don't wanna say good[D]bye
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Birds of a feather, we should stick together, I know ('Til the day that I [Bm]die)
I said I'd never think I wasn't better alone ('Til the light leaves my [Em]eyes)
Can't change the weather, might not be forever ('Til the day that I [A]die)
But if it's forever, it's even better
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Post-Chorus}
[D]I knew you in another [Bm]life
You had that same look in your [Em]eyes
I love you, don't act so sur[A]prised
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[D] [Bm] [Em] [A]
{end_of_verse}
